Date: Thu, 8 Oct 2026 08:01:51 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/4] Add local Discord bridge listener to the game server

Optional newline-delimited JSON bridge on 127.0.0.1:7199 for the PokeVerse-Discord
bot: HMAC-SHA256 challenge authentication, own network thread, bounded event and
message queues, keepalive and reconnect handling. Emits server state changes, GM
broadcasts and global save warnings; hands bot messages to Lua through the new
discordbridge globalevent. Disabled by default; secrets go in the optional,
git-ignored config.local.lua that is loaded after config.lua.
